@nsobid-BBA3811191DE71D9B55E53F918AE5DC1

# ARMS 5.5.1 - Disable FXAA

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Disables FXAA on the agl::pfx::FilterAA post effect.
//
// agl::pfx::FilterAA::draw checks the filter's enable flag and scale, then
// dispatches on antialias_type through a compare chain (2 SMAA, 1 ReduceAA,
// 0 falls through to FXAA). When the filter is off it copies the frame with
// ImageFilter2D::drawTexture instead. The branch guarding the FXAA
// fall-through now jumps to that copy, so the frame is passed through
// unfiltered while the other modes are left untouched.

@enabled
0099F540 0C000014   // B +0x30 to the pass-through copy (was CBNZ W9 guarding the FXAA case)
@stop

// Offsets reverse-engineered against ARMS 5.5.1 (Cstm/Lp + gsys/agl +
// sead, NVN). The retail build is symbol-stripped; every site was located
// by structure and byte-verified against the IDB before being written.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
